{"unit_id":"liuhaolong16__dsh-quote-reply#card-zh","repo":"liuhaolong16/dsh-quote-reply","commit":"8b302eed564b625233d3446b3f81b3bdb743b0f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-reply 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的引用回复插件。它在助手回答操作区加入“引用回复”按钮，并在输入框上方显示可管理的引用面板；选中的文字或整条回答可加入引用。引用由宿主通过 systemPrompt.context 注入后续模型回合，不进入用户消息正文，并可在对应回合尾部展开查看。用户可以逐条移除、清空和展开引用，引用也会在浏览器本地保存。需要 DSH 宿主的 webServer 与 systemPrompt 服务，不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:651-667","lib/client.js:710-735","lib/index.js:118-136","lib/index.js:144-189"]}
{"unit_id":"liuhaolong16__dsh-quote-reply#card-en","repo":"liuhaolong16/dsh-quote-reply","commit":"8b302eed564b625233d3446b3f81b3bdb743b0f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-quote-reply adds quoting to the DSH web client. Select answer text to save it in a tray above the composer, where quotes can be expanded, removed, or cleared. The host adds them to later model context, outside the message body. Quotes are stored in browser localStorage. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:651-667","lib/client.js:710-735","lib/index.js:118-136"]}
