{"unit_id":"liuhaolong16__dsh-quote-reply#feature-1","repo":"liuhaolong16/dsh-quote-reply","commit":"8b302eed564b625233d3446b3f81b3bdb743b0f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-reply 的功能「引用回答片段」：在助手回答的操作区点击“引用回复”，插件优先读取当前选中文字；没有选区时读取整条回答，并把内容加入引用列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:651-667"]}
